Z||000000||Babygirl||09-27-2000||11:24 PM||||She runs!  After discovering that our 1984 SE 2.5l threw a timing gear, we fixed her and she runs!  SOOOOOO much better than when we first bought her 3 weeks ago!  <P>The best part - we didn't have to drop the engine!!  We jacked up the back end of the car, removed the rear wheels, dropped the engine onto the cradle, and ROLLED the engine slightly forward, so we had access to the timing gear and cam shaft.  Replaced the timing gear, cam gear, push rods, plugs, wires, and belts.  She PUUUURRRRSSSSS!!  WooHoo!!  I love my Fiero!  Just thought we'd share!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>~Darcy & Laura<BR>1984 Black SE Fiero||||reg||10
Z||000001||StuGood||09-28-2000||12:02 AM||||Congratulations!  There's nothing like the feeling of bringing another Fiero back to life, is there?<P>Way to go!||||reg||14
